  "text": "Hi Ahmed,\n\nThanks for getting back to me so promptly. I'm glad to hear that the proposal has met your expectations so far.\n\nTo address your query regarding AI feature flexibility, our solutions like PulseSim Pro and AI Cirku-Tech are designed to be highly adaptive, ensuring they can integrate and evolve alongside your advancements. This adaptability helps mitigate the risk of system stagnation and keeps your operations optimal.\n\nRegarding pricing negotiations, we’re open to discussing further if you’re considering a larger purchase volume. We aim to provide the best value possible while maintaining the quality and efficient support TechPulse Solutions is known for.\n\nLet me know if you’d like to set up a call to delve deeper into these aspects. We’re eager to collaborate in a way that maximizes the benefits for LiftTech Elevations.\n\nLooking forward to your response.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nCarmen Silva\nSales Representative\nTechPulse Solutions",
